{"title":"Bowls league scorebook","genre":"software","brief":"Complete the following real project in the current, initially empty directory. Choose the deliverables, media, tools, structure and implementation that serve the intended user. Build usable artifacts and check your work. Deliver the project itself. Omit personally identifying credits, author signatures and model or toolchain identity labels. No network access or credentials are provided.\n\nBuild an offline scorebook for a six-team lawn bowls league. A win earns 2 standings points, a draw earns 1 per team, and an unplayed match earns none. Break standings ties by score difference, then scores for. Teams are Cedar, Fern, Lark, Moss, Reed, and Wren. Seed these fictional results: round 1, Cedar 14–9 Fern, Lark 11–11 Moss, Reed 8–13 Wren; round 2, Cedar 10–12 Lark, Fern 15–10 Reed, with Moss versus Wren unplayed. Let the secretary enter or correct scores, recalculate standings, and print a league table. Teams tied on every sporting criterion should share a rank.","works":{"9b2eadc9706ae139":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":6980,"sha256":"67c84e46d306e8469dd6936a0fc8d950c1152f80c7a35525a6a1a3aea98fc947","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Lawn Bowls League · Scorebook</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f6f5ef;color:#1a3931;font:16px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}header{background:#173d32;color:#fff;padding:18px max(5vw,calc((100vw - 1140px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.03em}.mark{width:31px;height:31px;border:2px solid #cee29c;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center}.mark:after{content:'';width:13px;height:13px;border:2px solid #cee29c;border-radius:50%;margin-left:7px}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:40px 30px}h1,h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.1}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,76px);margin:0;letter-spacing:-.05em}h2{font-size:33px;margin:0}p{margin:9px 0;color:#52665d}.intro,.heading,.match,.roundhead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.intro{border-bottom:1px solid #bac6b7;padding-bottom:25px;margin-bottom:28px}.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:start}section{background:#fffefa;border:1px solid #d4dace;border-radius:12px;padding:24px}.heading{margin-bottom:22px}button{font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;background:#214b3b;color:white;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ad8415;outline-offset:3px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}th,td{text-align:right;padding:13px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce0d7}thead th{background:#eef1e8;font-size:12px;color:#4b6255}th:nth-child(-n+2),td:first-child,tbody th{text-align:left}tbody td:last-child{color:#214b3b;font-weight:bold;background:#f1f5e9}.note,.status{font-size:13px}.roundhead{background:#edf1e7;border-radius:4px;padding:7px 10px;margin:15px 0 3px}.roundhead span{font-size:12px}.match{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 46px 9px 46px 1fr;gap:6px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e6dc}.match b{font-size:14px}.match b:last-child{text-align:right}input{width:100%;padding:6px 0;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #adbbae;background:#fffefa;color:inherit;text-align:center;font:inherit}.actions{margin-top:18px}.status{min-height:1.5em}button:hover{background:#30614b}@media(max-width:900px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:28px 4vw}section{padding:18px}}@media(max-width:470px){.intro{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.scroll{overflow:auto}th,td{padding:11px 3px;font-size:13px}}@media print{body,header,section{background:white;color:black}header{padding:0}.mark,.intro button,#fixtures,.status{display:none}main{padding:20px 0}.columns{display:block}section{border:0;padding:0}.intro{margin-bottom:16px}h1{font-size:36px}}\n</style></head><body><header><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Lawn Bowls League</header><main><div class=\"intro\"><div><h1>League scorebook</h1><p id=\"progress\"></p></div><button id=\"print\">Print league table</button></div><div class=\"columns\"><section aria-labelledby=\"st\"><div class=\"heading\"><h2 id=\"st\">Standings</h2></div><div class=\"scroll\"><table aria-label=\"League standings\"><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Team</th><th>P</th><th>W</th><th>D</th><th>L</th><th>For</th><th>Agst</th><th>Diff</th><th>Pts</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table></div><p class=\"note\">Win 2 points · Draw 1 point · Unplayed 0 points</p><p class=\"note\">Ties are decided by score difference, then scores for. Teams still level share a rank.</p></section><section id=\"fixtures\"><h2>Match scores</h2><p class=\"note\">Enter both scores, or clear both to mark a match unplayed.</p><form id=\"form\"><div id=\"rounds\"></div><div class=\"actions\"><button>Save scores</button></div></form><p class=\"status\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p></section></div></main>\n<script>\n'use strict';\nconst fixtures=[['Cedar','Fern'],['Lark','Moss'],['Reed','Wren'],['Cedar','Lark'],['Fern','Reed'],['Moss','Wren']];\nconst seed=[[14,9],[11,11],[8,13],[10,12],[15,10],[null,null]];\nconst key='lawn-bowls-six.scorebook.v1';\nconst el=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nlet scores=seed;\nfunction valid(pair){return Array.isArray(pair)&&pair.length===2&&(pair.every(n=>n===null)||pair.every(n=>Number.isInteger(n)&&n>=0&&n<=999999))}\ntry{const raw=localStorage.getItem(key);if(raw!==null){const saved=JSON.parse(raw);if(!Array.isArray(saved)||saved.length!==6||!saved.every(valid))throw Error();scores=saved}}\ncatch{el('status').textContent='Saved scores could not be loaded. Showing the original results.'}\nfunction standings(results){\n const teams=new Map(fixtures.flat().map(name=>[name,{name,p:0,w:0,d:0,l:0,f:0,a:0,diff:0,pts:0}]));\n results.forEach((pair,i)=>{if(pair[0]===null)return;\n fixtures[i].forEach((name,j)=>{const t=teams.get(name),f=pair[j],a=pair[1-j];t.p++;t.f+=f;t.a+=a;t.diff+=f-a;if(f>a){t.w++;t.pts+=2}else if(f===a){t.d++;t.pts++}else t.l++})});\n const sorted=[...teams.values()].sort((a,b)=>b.pts-a.pts||b.diff-a.diff||b.f-a.f||a.name.localeCompare(b.name));\n sorted.forEach((t,i)=>{const prev=sorted[i-1];t.rank=prev&&prev.pts===t.pts&&prev.diff===t.diff&&prev.f===t.f?prev.rank:i+1});return sorted\n}\nfunction render(){el('rows').innerHTML=standings(scores).map(t=>`<tr><td>${t.rank}</td><th scope=\"row\">${t.name}</th>${[t.p,t.w,t.d,t.l,t.f,t.a,t.diff>0?'+'+t.diff:t.diff,t.pts].map(n=>'<td>'+n+'</td>').join('')}</tr>`).join('');\n el('progress').textContent='6 teams · '+scores.filter(s=>s[0]!==null).length+' of 6 matches played';\n for(let r=0;r<2;r++)el('count'+r).textContent=scores.slice(3*r,3*r+3).filter(s=>s[0]!==null).length+' / 3 played'\n}\nel('rounds').innerHTML=fixtures.map((names,i)=>{const round=Math.floor(i/3)+1;\n const input=j=>`<input aria-label=\"Round ${round}, ${names[j]} score against ${names[1-j]}\" id=\"s${i}${j}\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]{1,6}\" title=\"Enter a whole number from 0 to 999999\" placeholder=\"–\" value=\"${scores[i][j]??''}\">`;\n return (i%3===0?`<div class=\"roundhead\"><strong>Round ${round}</strong><span id=\"count${round-1}\"></span></div>`:'')+`<div class=\"match\"><b>${names[0]}</b>${input(0)}–${input(1)}<b>${names[1]}</b></div>`}).join('');\nrender();\nel('form').oninput=()=>{el('status').textContent='Unsaved score changes.'};\nel('form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const next=[];\n for(let i=0;i<fixtures.length;i++){const pair=[0,1].map(j=>el('s'+i+j).value).map(s=>s===''?null:Number(s));if(!valid(pair)){el('status').textContent='Enter both scores for '+fixtures[i].join(' versus ')+', or clear both.';el('s'+i+pair.indexOf(null)).focus();return}next.push(pair)}\n scores=next;render();try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(scores));el('status').textContent='Scores saved on this device.'}catch{el('status').textContent='Standings updated for this session. Browser storage is unavailable.'}};\nel('print').onclick=()=>window.print();\n</script></body></html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/aa1da50e11d9651ccc7ce4915182732a3ccecebdf6173cf0b57c864500554b7d.zip"},"c86373b7f323b884":{"files":[{"name":"index.html","bytes":26394,"sha256":"60d690693be5ed37418c3ca8960a51ff0607a0e842c44f281ec7a6fc79e898fd","kind":"text","body":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Lawn Bowls League · Scorebook</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    color-scheme: light;\n    --paper: #f4f1e8;\n    --surface: #fffcf6;\n    --ink: #182d24;\n    --muted: #526158;\n    --line: #dedfd4;\n    --green: #194b36;\n    --green-dark: #15382b;\n    --green-soft: #e9efe5;\n    --gold: #ead399;\n    --pending: #77521b;\n    --pending-bg: #f8ecd1;\n    --error: #922c21;\n    --serif: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;\n    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; }\n  h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }\n  button, input { font: inherit; }\n  button {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n    transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;\n  }\n  :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #9a5a10; outline-offset: 3px; }\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  .sr-only {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    padding: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip-path: inset(50%);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .skip-link {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 2;\n    top: .5rem;\n    left: .5rem;\n    padding: .65rem 1rem;\n    background: var(--surface);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    transform: translateY(-150%);\n  }\n  .skip-link:focus { transform: none; }\n\n  .wrap { width: min(100% - 5rem, 77.5rem); margin-inline: auto; }\n  .masthead { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .masthead .wrap {\n    min-height: 4.4rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n  }\n  .identity {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: .75rem;\n    font-size: .8rem;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: .095em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .mark {\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 2.1rem;\n    height: 2.1rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--green);\n    color: var(--gold);\n  }\n  .mark::before {\n    content: '';\n    width: 1.06rem;\n    height: 1.06rem;\n    border: 1px solid currentColor;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px var(--green), inset 0 0 0 4px currentColor;\n  }\n  .offline { color: var(--muted); font-size: .83rem; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .offline::before {\n    content: '';\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: .45rem;\n    height: .45rem;\n    margin-right: .48rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    vertical-align: .09em;\n    background: #427651;\n  }\n\n  main { padding-block: 2rem 2.5rem; }\n  .hero {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: grid;\n    align-content: center;\n    min-height: 12.25rem;\n    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;\n    border-radius: 1.05rem;\n    background: var(--green-dark);\n    color: #fcf7e9;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font: 400 clamp(2.65rem, 6.2vw, 4.8rem)/1 var(--serif);\n    letter-spacing: -.055em;\n    max-width: 12ch;\n  }\n  .hero p { margin-top: .85rem; color: #dce8d9; font-size: 1rem; }\n  .green-art {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    inset: 0 0 0 50%;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(146deg, transparent 0 47px, #bdd4a312 48px 49px),\n      linear-gradient(98deg, var(--green-dark), #28593f);\n    mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 34%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .rink {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    right: 13%;\n    width: 18rem;\n    aspect-ratio: 1;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    border: 1px solid #e8d6a44a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 1.48rem, #e8d6a44a 1.49rem 1.53rem, transparent 1.55rem 2.12rem);\n  }\n  .bowl, .jack {\n    position: absolute;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: .3rem .4rem .7rem #10271f70;\n  }\n  .bowl {\n    width: 2.55rem;\n    aspect-ratio: 1;\n    background: #1c392f;\n    border: 1px solid #a5b897;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n  }\n  .bowl::before {\n    content: '';\n    width: 43%;\n    aspect-ratio: 1;\n    border: 1px solid #c5d2ac;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #1c392f, 0 0 0 4px #c5d2ac88;\n  }\n  .bowl.one { top: 27%; left: 26%; }\n  .bowl.two { top: 49%; right: 20%; background: #b48a51; }\n  .bowl.two::before { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #b48a51, 0 0 0 4px #efe0be88; border-color: #f2e2ba; }\n  .bowl.three { bottom: 20%; left: 36%; }\n  .jack { width: .86rem; aspect-ratio: 1; left: 48%; top: 48%; background: #f4e5bd; }\n\n  .dashboard {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: start;\n    gap: 1.4rem;\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .panel {\n    min-width: 0;\n    background: var(--surface);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: .95rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px #172c2310;\n  }\n  .panel-head {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: .65rem 1rem;\n    padding: 1.35rem 1.45rem 1.15rem;\n  }\n  h2 { font: 400 2.02rem/1.1 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.035em; }\n  .panel-head p { margin-top: .3rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; }\n  .button {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: .5rem;\n    min-height: 2.75rem;\n    padding: .52rem .85rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: .48rem;\n    background: var(--surface);\n    color: var(--green);\n    font-size: .85rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .button:hover { background: var(--green-soft); border-color: #aab9aa; }\n  .button:active { background: #dbe6d8; }\n  .primary { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #fff; }\n  .primary:hover, .primary:active { background: var(--green-dark); border-color: var(--green-dark); }\n  .printer {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: .9rem;\n    height: .6rem;\n    border: 1px solid currentColor;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .printer::before, .printer::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 2px;\n    right: 2px;\n    height: .35rem;\n    border: 1px solid currentColor;\n    background: var(--surface);\n  }\n  .printer::before { bottom: calc(100% + 1px); border-bottom: 0; }\n  .printer::after { bottom: -.22rem; }\n  .table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  }\n  .table .rank { width: 9%; }\n  .table .team { width: 22%; }\n  .table .number { width: 8.625%; }\n  .table tbody th, .table thead th:nth-child(2) { text-align: left; padding-left: .4rem; }\n  .table thead { background: #eef0e8; color: #42554a; }\n  .table thead th {\n    padding: .65rem .12rem;\n    font-size: .73rem;\n    letter-spacing: .025em;\n  }\n  .table abbr { text-decoration: none; }\n  .table td, .table tbody th {\n    height: 3.25rem;\n    padding: .55rem .12rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n    font-size: .92rem;\n  }\n  .table tbody th { font-weight: 680; }\n  .table tbody td:first-child { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; }\n  .table tbody tr:hover { background: #f6f7ef; }\n  .table td:last-child { color: var(--green); font-weight: 750; background: #edf2e980; }\n  .positive { color: var(--green); }\n  .table-notes {\n    padding: .95rem 1.45rem 1.1rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n  }\n  .table-notes p + p { margin-top: .4rem; }\n\n  .fixtures .panel-head { padding-bottom: .95rem; }\n  .round { padding-inline: 1.35rem; }\n  .round + .round { margin-top: .15rem; }\n  .round h3 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: .75rem;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: .43rem .65rem;\n    border-radius: .35rem;\n    background: #eef0e8;\n    color: #354e41;\n    font-size: .72rem;\n    letter-spacing: .1em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .round-count { font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; font-size: .75rem; }\n  .match-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }\n  .match { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .match:last-child { border: 0; }\n  .match-button {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(4.8rem, auto) minmax(0, 1fr) 1rem;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: .45rem;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 2.85rem;\n    padding: .3rem .35rem .3rem .65rem;\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: .34rem;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-size: .87rem;\n    font-weight: 620;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .match-button:hover { background: var(--green-soft); }\n  .match-button:active { background: #dbe6d8; }\n  .match-button .away { text-align: right; padding-right: .22rem; }\n  .score {\n    justify-self: center;\n    max-width: 8rem;\n    padding: .15rem .42rem;\n    border-radius: .31rem;\n    background: var(--green-soft);\n    color: var(--green);\n    font-size: .84rem;\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n  }\n  .pending { background: var(--pending-bg); color: var(--pending); font-size: .73rem; }\n  .chevron {\n    width: .4rem;\n    height: .4rem;\n    justify-self: center;\n    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--muted);\n    border-right: 1.5px solid var(--muted);\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n  .fixture-foot {\n    min-height: 3.3rem;\n    margin: .35rem 1.35rem 0;\n    padding: .78rem .15rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--muted);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n  }\n  .storage-warning {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    padding: .65rem .9rem;\n    border-radius: .45rem;\n    background: var(--pending-bg);\n    color: var(--pending);\n    font-size: .9rem;\n  }\n\n  dialog {\n    width: min(100% - 2rem, 30rem);\n    max-height: calc(100% - 2rem);\n    padding: 1.55rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: .9rem;\n    background: var(--surface);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    box-shadow: 0 1rem 3rem #13271d35;\n  }\n  dialog::backdrop { background: #152d2380; }\n  .editor-round {\n    margin-bottom: .45rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    font-size: .76rem;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: .09em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }\n  .fields label { display: grid; gap: .4rem; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 660; }\n  .fields input {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 2.8rem;\n    padding: .5rem .65rem;\n    border: 1px solid #aab6a8;\n    border-radius: .45rem;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n  .fields input[aria-invalid=\"true\"] { border-color: var(--error); }\n  .hint, .error { margin-top: .85rem; font-size: .85rem; }\n  .hint { color: var(--muted); }\n  .error { color: var(--error); }\n  .dialog-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .55rem; margin-top: 1.3rem; }\n  .print-only { display: none; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 58rem) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 3rem); }\n    .dashboard { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 34rem) {\n    .wrap { width: calc(100% - 1.5rem); }\n    .masthead .wrap { min-height: 3.55rem; gap: .5rem; }\n    .identity { font-size: .67rem; letter-spacing: .065em; gap: .5rem; }\n    .offline { font-size: .74rem; }\n    main { padding-block: 1rem 1.4rem; }\n    .hero { padding: 1.35rem 1.05rem; min-height: 10rem; }\n    .hero p { font-size: .88rem; }\n    .green-art { opacity: .38; inset-inline-start: 40%; }\n    .rink { width: 13rem; right: -4.5rem; }\n    .dashboard { margin-top: .9rem; gap: .9rem; }\n    .panel-head { padding: .9rem .85rem .8rem; }\n    h2 { font-size: 1.75rem; }\n    .table thead th, .table tbody td:first-child { font-size: .72rem; }\n    .table td, .table tbody th { font-size: .79rem; height: 2.75rem; }\n    .table-notes { padding: .8rem .85rem; }\n    .round { padding-inline: .8rem; }\n    .fixture-foot { margin-inline: .8rem; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after { transition: none !important; }\n  }\n  @page { margin: 16mm; }\n  @media print {\n    :root, body { background: white; color: black; }\n    .masthead, .hero, .fixtures, .skip-link, .storage-warning, .print-button, dialog { display: none !important; }\n    .print-only { display: block; }\n    .wrap { width: 100%; }\n    main { padding: 0; }\n    .dashboard { display: block; margin-top: 1.1rem; }\n    .print-only h1 { font: 400 28pt/1.2 var(--serif); }\n    .panel { border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: white; box-shadow: none; }\n    .panel-head { padding: 0 0 .7rem; }\n    .panel-head p, .table td, .table tbody td:first-child, .table-notes { color: black; }\n    .table thead, .table td:last-child { color: black; background: none; }\n    .table thead th { border-top: 2px solid #222; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; }\n    .table td, .table tbody th { height: auto; padding-block: .6rem; border-color: #aaa; }\n    .table tr { break-inside: avoid; }\n    .table-notes { padding-inline: 0; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to scorebook</a>\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"identity\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Lawn Bowls League</div>\n    <span class=\"offline\">Offline scorebook</span>\n  </div>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>League scorebook</h1>\n    <p>6 teams <span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span> 2 rounds</p>\n    <div class=\"green-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"rink\"><i class=\"bowl one\"></i><i class=\"bowl two\"></i><i class=\"bowl three\"></i><i class=\"jack\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"print-only\"><h1>Lawn Bowls League</h1></div>\n  <noscript><p class=\"storage-warning\">Enable JavaScript in your browser to use the scorebook.</p></noscript>\n  <p id=\"storage-warning\" class=\"storage-warning\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n  <div class=\"dashboard\">\n    <section class=\"panel standings\" aria-labelledby=\"standings-title\">\n      <header class=\"panel-head\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"standings-title\">League table</h2>\n          <p id=\"table-summary\"></p>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"print\" class=\"button print-button\"><span class=\"printer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Print table</button>\n      </header>\n      <table class=\"table\" aria-labelledby=\"standings-title\" aria-describedby=\"table-notes\">\n        <colgroup><col class=\"rank\"><col class=\"team\"><col span=\"8\" class=\"number\"></colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Rank</span></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Team</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Played\">P</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Won\">W</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Drawn\">D</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Lost\">L</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Scores for\">SF</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Scores against\">SA</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Score difference\">SD</abbr></th>\n            <th scope=\"col\"><abbr title=\"Standings points\">Pts</abbr></th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"league-rows\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n      <div id=\"table-notes\" class=\"table-notes\">\n        <p>Win 2 points · Draw 1 point per team · Unplayed 0 points</p>\n        <p>Ranked by points, score difference, then scores for. Teams equal on all three share a rank.</p>\n        <p>P played · W won · D drawn · L lost · SF scores for · SA scores against · SD score difference</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"panel fixtures\" aria-labelledby=\"fixtures-title\">\n      <header class=\"panel-head\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"fixtures-title\">Match results</h2>\n          <p>Select a match to enter or correct its score.</p>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n      <div id=\"rounds\"></div>\n      <p class=\"fixture-foot\" id=\"save-status\" role=\"status\">Scores are saved in this browser.</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<dialog id=\"editor\" aria-labelledby=\"editor-title\">\n  <form id=\"score-form\" novalidate>\n    <p class=\"editor-round\" id=\"editor-round\"></p>\n    <h2 id=\"editor-title\">Edit score</h2>\n    <div class=\"fields\">\n      <label><span id=\"home-name\"></span><input id=\"home-score\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"score-hint score-error\" autofocus></label>\n      <label><span id=\"away-name\"></span><input id=\"away-score\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"score-hint score-error\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"hint\" id=\"score-hint\">Enter two whole scores of zero or more. Leave both blank to mark the match unplayed.</p>\n    <p class=\"error\" id=\"score-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n    <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel\" class=\"button\">Cancel</button>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\">Save result</button>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</dialog>\n\n<script>\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  const teams = [\"Cedar\", \"Fern\", \"Lark\", \"Moss\", \"Reed\", \"Wren\"];\n  const fixtures = [\n    { id: \"r1-cedar-fern\", round: 1, home: \"Cedar\", away: \"Fern\", seed: [14, 9] },\n    { id: \"r1-lark-moss\", round: 1, home: \"Lark\", away: \"Moss\", seed: [11, 11] },\n    { id: \"r1-reed-wren\", round: 1, home: \"Reed\", away: \"Wren\", seed: [8, 13] },\n    { id: \"r2-cedar-lark\", round: 2, home: \"Cedar\", away: \"Lark\", seed: [10, 12] },\n    { id: \"r2-fern-reed\", round: 2, home: \"Fern\", away: \"Reed\", seed: [15, 10] },\n    { id: \"r2-moss-wren\", round: 2, home: \"Moss\", away: \"Wren\", seed: null }\n  ];\n  const storagePrefix = \"lawn-bowls-league-scorebook-v1:\";\n  const maxScore = Math.floor(Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER / fixtures.length);\n  const seeds = Object.fromEntries(fixtures.map(({ id, seed }) => [id, seed]));\n  const byId = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const warning = byId(\"storage-warning\");\n  const status = byId(\"save-status\");\n  const leagueRows = byId(\"league-rows\");\n  const rounds = byId(\"rounds\");\n  const editor = byId(\"editor\");\n  const scoreForm = byId(\"score-form\");\n  const fields = [byId(\"home-score\"), byId(\"away-score\")];\n  const scoreError = byId(\"score-error\");\n\n  let storageIssue = \"\";\n  let canWrite = true;\n  let results = readResults();\n  let activeFixture = null;\n\n  function validScore(score) {\n    return Number.isSafeInteger(score) && score >= 0 && score <= maxScore;\n  }\n\n  function readResults() {\n    const scores = { ...seeds };\n    try {\n      for (const { id } of fixtures) {\n        const raw = localStorage.getItem(storagePrefix + id);\n        if (raw === null) continue;\n        try {\n          const pair = JSON.parse(raw);\n          if (pair !== null && !(Array.isArray(pair) && pair.length === 2 && pair.every(validScore))) {\n            throw new Error(\"Invalid scores\");\n          }\n          scores[id] = pair;\n        } catch {\n          storageIssue = \"Some saved scores could not be read. Their starting scores are shown. Changes will last for this session only.\";\n          canWrite = false;\n        }\n      }\n    } catch {\n      storageIssue = \"Browser storage is unavailable. Scores entered here will last until you close or reload this page.\";\n      canWrite = false;\n    }\n    return scores;\n  }\n\n  function sportingOrder(a, b) {\n    return b.points - a.points || b.difference - a.difference || b.for - a.for;\n  }\n\n  function calculateStandings(scores) {\n    const stats = Object.fromEntries(teams.map(team => [\n      team, { team, played: 0, won: 0, drawn: 0, lost: 0, for: 0, against: 0, difference: 0, points: 0 }\n    ]));\n\n    for (const { id, home, away } of fixtures) {\n      const pair = scores[id];\n      if (pair === null) continue;\n      const [homeScore, awayScore] = pair;\n      record(stats[home], homeScore, awayScore);\n      record(stats[away], awayScore, homeScore);\n    }\n\n    const ordered = Object.values(stats).sort((a, b) => sportingOrder(a, b) || a.team.localeCompare(b.team));\n    ordered.forEach((row, index) => {\n      const previous = ordered[index - 1];\n      row.rank = previous && sportingOrder(previous, row) === 0 ? previous.rank : index + 1;\n    });\n    return ordered;\n  }\n\n  function record(team, score, opponentScore) {\n    team.played += 1;\n    team.for += score;\n    team.against += opponentScore;\n    team.difference = team.for - team.against;\n    if (score > opponentScore) {\n      team.won += 1;\n      team.points += 2;\n    } else if (score === opponentScore) {\n      team.drawn += 1;\n      team.points += 1;\n    } else {\n      team.lost += 1;\n    }\n  }\n\n  function renderStandings() {\n    const standings = calculateStandings(results);\n    leagueRows.innerHTML = standings.map(row => {\n      const diff = row.difference > 0 ? \"+\" + row.difference : String(row.difference).replace(\"-\", \"−\");\n      return `<tr>\n        <td>${row.rank}</td><th scope=\"row\">${row.team}</th><td>${row.played}</td>\n        <td>${row.won}</td><td>${row.drawn}</td><td>${row.lost}</td><td>${row.for}</td>\n        <td>${row.against}</td><td class=\"${row.difference > 0 ? 'positive' : ''}\">${diff}</td><td>${row.points}</td>\n      </tr>`;\n    }).join(\"\");\n    const played = fixtures.filter(({ id }) => results[id] !== null).length;\n    byId(\"table-summary\").textContent = `${played} of ${fixtures.length} matches played`;\n  }\n\n  function renderFixtures() {\n    const roundNumbers = [...new Set(fixtures.map(fixture => fixture.round))];\n    rounds.innerHTML = roundNumbers.map(round => {\n      const matches = fixtures.filter(fixture => fixture.round === round);\n      const played = matches.filter(({ id }) => results[id] !== null).length;\n      const items = matches.map(({ id, home, away }) => {\n        const score = results[id];\n        const displayScore = score ? score.join(\" – \") : \"Unplayed\";\n        const description = score\n          ? `Edit score, round ${round}, ${home} ${score[0]}, ${away} ${score[1]}`\n          : `Enter score, round ${round}, ${home} versus ${away}, unplayed`;\n        return `<li class=\"match\"><button class=\"match-button\" type=\"button\" data-id=\"${id}\" aria-label=\"${description}\">\n          <span>${home}</span><span class=\"score ${score ? '' : 'pending'}\">${displayScore}</span>\n          <span class=\"away\">${away}</span><span class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </button></li>`;\n      }).join(\"\");\n\n      return `<section class=\"round\" aria-labelledby=\"round-${round}\"><h3 id=\"round-${round}\">\n        Round ${round}<span class=\"round-count\">${played} / ${matches.length} played</span></h3>\n        <ul class=\"match-list\">${items}</ul></section>`;\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function showStorageIssue() {\n    warning.hidden = !storageIssue;\n    warning.textContent = storageIssue;\n  }\n\n  function clearError() {\n    scoreError.hidden = true;\n    scoreError.textContent = \"\";\n    fields.forEach(field => field.removeAttribute(\"aria-invalid\"));\n  }\n\n  function fieldError(message, invalidFields) {\n    scoreError.textContent = message;\n    scoreError.hidden = false;\n    invalidFields.forEach(field => field.setAttribute(\"aria-invalid\", \"true\"));\n    invalidFields[0].focus();\n  }\n\n  rounds.addEventListener(\"click\", event => {\n    const button = event.target.closest(\"button[data-id]\");\n    if (!button) return;\n    activeFixture = fixtures.find(fixture => fixture.id === button.dataset.id);\n    const { id, home, away, round } = activeFixture;\n    const score = results[id];\n    byId(\"editor-round\").textContent = `Round ${round}`;\n    byId(\"editor-title\").textContent = score ? \"Edit score\" : \"Enter score\";\n    byId(\"home-name\").textContent = home;\n    byId(\"away-name\").textContent = away;\n    fields.forEach((field, index) => { field.value = score ? score[index] : \"\"; });\n    clearError();\n    editor.showModal();\n    fields[0].select();\n  });\n\n  scoreForm.addEventListener(\"submit\", event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    clearError();\n    const entries = fields.map(field => field.value.trim());\n    const blanks = entries.map(entry => entry === \"\");\n    let score = null;\n    if (blanks.some(Boolean) && !blanks.every(Boolean)) {\n      fieldError(\"Enter both scores, or leave both blank.\", fields.filter((_, index) => blanks[index]));\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!blanks.every(Boolean)) {\n      score = entries.map(Number);\n      const invalid = fields.filter((_, index) => !/^\\d+$/.test(entries[index]) || !validScore(score[index]));\n      if (invalid.length) {\n        fieldError(`Enter whole numbers from 0 to ${maxScore.toLocaleString()}.`, invalid);\n        return;\n      }\n    }\n\n    const { id, home, away } = activeFixture;\n    // Each fixture has its own key so simultaneous edits to different fixtures are retained.\n    if (canWrite) results = readResults();\n    results[id] = score;\n    let saved = false;\n    if (canWrite) {\n      try {\n        localStorage.setItem(storagePrefix + id, JSON.stringify(score));\n        storageIssue = \"\";\n        saved = true;\n      } catch {\n        storageIssue = \"The browser could not save this change. It is visible while this page remains open.\";\n        canWrite = false;\n      }\n    }\n    renderStandings();\n    renderFixtures();\n    showStorageIssue();\n    editor.close();\n    const fixtureName = `${home} vs ${away}`;\n    const change = score ? `${fixtureName} score updated` : `${fixtureName} marked unplayed`;\n    status.textContent = saved ? `${change}. Saved in this browser.` : `${change} for this session.`;\n  });\n\n  byId(\"cancel\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => editor.close());\n  editor.addEventListener(\"close\", () => {\n    if (editor.open || !activeFixture) return;\n    rounds.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${activeFixture.id}\"]`).focus();\n    activeFixture = null;\n  });\n  byId(\"print\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => window.print());\n\n  window.addEventListener(\"storage\", event => {\n    if (!canWrite || (event.key !== null && !event.key.startsWith(storagePrefix))) return;\n    const latest = readResults();\n    showStorageIssue();\n    if (!canWrite) return;\n    const focusedId = document.activeElement.dataset.id;\n    results = latest;\n    renderStandings();\n    renderFixtures();\n    if (focusedId) rounds.querySelector(`[data-id=\"${focusedId}\"]`)?.focus();\n    status.textContent = \"Scores refreshed from this browser.\";\n  });\n\n  renderStandings();\n  renderFixtures();\n  showStorageIssue();\n  if (!canWrite) status.textContent = \"Scores are available for this session.\";\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"download":"data/release/assets/65646e18c464f1e297a668b3c05c91a379d079c5606890ebf4a747cd55a0d3b6.zip"}}}
